    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Description
      value: A demorphed dead body was found in the middle of the parking lot near
        Godwick House. The body was stripped of clothes and was left bare naked.
        It has feminine features. Maybe Mr Godwick has seen something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
