    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[0].Description
      value: The body is in the middle. A plethora of stones are around the body.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[1].Description
      value: The house is well decorated and pretty spacious.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[2].Description
      value: There's really weird behaviour around this place. Mostly by the Rooks,
        the masked gang. A lot of the buildings there miss some bricks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[3].Description
      value: Nothing suspicious in the park this time
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[4].Description
      value: A branch probably fallen from a nearby tree.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[5].Description
      value: The rock has blood on it and it seems like it's fallen off a building
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[6].Description
      value: A well crafted knife
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[7].Description
      value: You found a dead body on my parking lot? Almost none lives in this appartment
        complex. Just me, my wife Cynthia and Miss Harington.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].Description
      value: I'm sorry detective I didn't see anything. The last person I saw leaving
        this building is Cynthia. Ask her parents, the weasleys.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[9].Description
      value: I don't know where Cynthia is. Probably out. She liked those twin girls
        in Mark Avenue. Ask them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[10].Description
      value: Johnathan seems anxious about Cynthia. You know something detective?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[11].Description
      value: Again my sister is innocent. Cynthia is not here. And won't come. The
        rooks murdered her. Why? Ask them yourself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[12].Description
      value: I- I- I don't know anything I swear.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[13].Description
      value: Who are you and what do you want? Detective? Oh s***t! I'm sorry. I
        don't know anything. Ask Ronald he's in charge.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[14].Description
      value: ' I won''t answer anything without my lawyer. Yes, Cynthia owed us money
        but, you can''t prove any connection of her death to us.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4552144494010031641, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4552144494010031641, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 70.15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
