      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 408c50bd620ab1540a59efb4b9f78072, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].CardFace
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d4651d5443271d4b8a52594ce4ae8e2, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].IsInCase
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[9].CardFace
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -5372408452435379571, guid: 6676b3649880ad844aa6346c2a6f0a03, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[9].IsInCase
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[10].CardFace
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -5372408452435379571, guid: 6676b3649880ad844aa6346c2a6f0a03, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[10].IsInCase
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[0].Description
      value: The park is mostly silent. Though a few footprints leading towards the
        Dean District.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[1].Description
      value: Nothing Special Here
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[2].Description
      value: The street is as busy as always, but let's leave before Drevin sniffs
        us out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[3].Description
      value: A lot of weird figgures are scattered around here. Mostly those of the
        Rooks, the maksed gank. One of the twin sisters looked at you weirdly.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[4].Description
      value: This bag has only trash in it
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[5].Description
      value: This bag has art utencils in it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[6].Description
      value: This bag contains drugs and a letter towards a C.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[7].Description
      value: I have no clue what happened to the park. Me and my sister were at our
        home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].Description
      value: I- I- think I saw Don walking towards the park with that bag. I'm not
        sure though.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[9].Description
      value: Yes, I did put the bag there, but I didn't know what had in there. Ronald
        made me put it there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[10].Description
      value: I won't say anything without a lawyer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4552144494010031641, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4552144494010031641, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 70.15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
