    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[0].Description
      value: The big house seems fine, but drawers seem open here and there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[1].Description
      value: This is the main park of the city. Nothing the unsual this time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[2].Description
      value: ' The company jonathan owns. The secretary said that the documents were
        held in a brown book.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[3].Description
      value: It seems Mr Godwick fixed his car and added a new paintjob
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[4].Description
      value: These are all Pizza adverbs, coupons and a pamphlet about BLM.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[5].Description
      value: Inside the Envelope there are all the missing pages from the Brown Book.
        Seems like Cynthia Godwick has something to do with it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[6].Description
      value: This forlder has the documentation of Fredricsen's firing
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[7].Description
      value: This book is filled with crucial information about Dorondo. Some pages
        are ripped off. Some blonde hair are caught into it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].Description
      value: Detective, I became once more a victim. They stole my documents regarding
        my company.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[9].Description
      value: I swear, it wasn't me this time. I won't get lost in this conflict again.
        Sorry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[10].Description
      value: I'm sure it was that low-life Fredricsen. It's always him!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[11].Description
      value: They accused me again? I'm gonna quit. Of course I'm innocent. Luke
        maybe knows something
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[12].Description
      value: ' I know nothing. I only saw Ms Godwick with an envelope leaving her
        house.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4552144494010031641, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4552144494010031641, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 70.15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
