    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[0].Description
      value: 'This door doesn''t seem to have anything wrong, so the person is good. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[1].Description
      value: This hanger was fallen in the floor of the house.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[2].Description
      value: There isn't anything of use here
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[3].Description
      value: I lost the ring that I wanted to give to my wife. How will I propose
        now? Can you ask the locksmith what happened to the door?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[4].Description
      value: Desmond's door was open when he arrived home. Nothing else was missing
        except the ring for his wife.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[5].Description
      value: Yes, I did it, I stole the ring. I am not ready for mariage. I didn't
        want Desmond to propose to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[6].Description
      value: I didn't do anything, bro.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[7].Description
      value: You can blame me for a lot of things. Not for this one tho.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].Description
      value: 'Desmond''s door has been compromised. Seems like it''s the job of a '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
