    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[0].Description
      value: I didn't do anything, I swear. I was at my house.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[1].Description
      value: Just a lot of items scattered around.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[2].Description
      value: I found the body in the middle of the alley. Someone must hit it with
        something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[3].Description
      value: A dog toy found somewhere in the alley.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[4].Description
      value: I didn't do anything. I swear. I was doing construction work at that
        time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[5].Description
      value: A bloody rock that was found near the body. It has blonde hairstrands
        on it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[6].Description
      value: The body is placed here with a plethora of rocks. The body seems to
        have brunette hair.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[7].Description
      value: I did it, yes. He was hitting me all the time, I had to protect myself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[8].Description
      value: This is a cute little vintage home. Nothing fancy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[9].Description
      value: Why are you asking me these questions? I didn't do a thing!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3876988909433394753, guid: 66a4874a03cc566499a5025fc6b9eae3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: CaseList.Array.data[10].Description
      value: A simple clock found in the garbage.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
